Inside the detector window `(1, 8/3)`, the only Galois-and-ODE survivors are `δ = 2` with partition `[2,1]` and `δ = 5/2` with `[1,1,1]`. ODE-only extras with `den > 3` exist (`9/4`, `13/5`, `17/7`, …) and are all Galois-killed. The `(99,66)` split-order decider is exhaustive over those two branches; both face lifts remain open. No Keller witness, no `charge_basis` line.

